## Known Issues

1. **Build Error: /test page prerendering fails on Vercel**
   - The /app/test/page.tsx (or similar) throws an error during build time prerendering
   - Status: NEEDS FIX before next deployment
   - Solution: Either delete /test page if it's development-only, or add `export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic'` to skip prerendering
   - Impact: Blocks deployments to production

2. **GitHub Repo Permissions on Vercel**
   - Cursor pushes from local machine (nhattran@Nhats-MacBook-Air.local) fail because not added to Vercel team
   - Status: RESOLVED - repo is now public, deployments should work
   - Note: Making the repo public allows Vercel to deploy without team member restrictions


